WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:17.950
"What a wonderful banquet!" said the queen.

2
00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:20.794
The king looked very proud.

3
00:00:20.795 --> 00:00:32.196
"Wait till the guests see the new jester!" he said.

4
00:00:32.197 --> 00:00:39.570
Dirk pushed Tink into the room.

5
00:00:39.571 --> 00:00:42.672
Tink put a ball on his hat and bowed.

6
00:00:42.673 --> 00:00:45.088
The ball fell off.

7
00:00:45.089 --> 00:00:49.147
No one laughed.

8
00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.176
The king frowned.

9
00:00:51.177 --> 00:00:56.301
"Pull a rabbit from that hat!" said the king.

10
00:00:56.302 --> 00:01:00.957
"Or go to the Grim Dungeon!" snapped Dirk.

11
00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:03.724
Tink looked scared.

12
00:01:03.725 --> 00:01:06.802
"Poor Tink," thought Tom.

13
00:01:06.803 --> 00:01:09.253
"Umm," said Tink.

14
00:01:09.254 --> 00:01:16.762
"I don't know . . ."

15
00:01:16.763 --> 00:01:18.867
He took off his hat.

16
00:01:18.868 --> 00:01:22.427
Tom quickly waved his wand.

17
00:01:22.428 --> 00:01:27.616
Poof! A rabbit appeared.

18
00:01:27.617 --> 00:01:32.085
The guests cheered.

19
00:01:32.086 --> 00:01:39.378
"Bravo!" cried the king.

20
00:01:39.379 --> 00:01:43.733
"Next I'll spin a pie on a stick," Tink said.

21
00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:47.023
Tink looked at Tom.

22
00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:50.970
Nervously Tink spun the pie on the stick.

23
00:01:50.971 --> 00:01:53.722
The pie wobbled.

24
00:01:53.723 --> 00:01:55.912
"Uh-oh!" Tom said.

25
00:01:55.913 --> 00:01:58.483
He waved his wand.

26
00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:13.224
"Pie, stay! Don't fly away!"

27
00:02:13.225 --> 00:02:16.082
The pie flew through the air!

28
00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:25.204
Splat! It hit the king.

29
00:02:25.205 --> 00:02:30.159
The queen laughed.

30
00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:34.796
The guests laughed too.

31
00:02:34.797 --> 00:02:40.526
"That jester is funny!" some guests cried.

32
00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:42.756
But the king was angry.

33
00:02:42.757 --> 00:02:47.708
Everybody was laughing at him!

34
00:02:47.709 --> 00:02:55.083
"Off to the Grim Dungeon!" yelled the king.

35
00:02:55.084 --> 00:03:02.660
Dirk dragged Tink away.

36
00:03:02.661 --> 00:03:06.195
"It's my fault!" Tom said to Cat.

37
00:03:06.196 --> 00:03:11.457
"I have to help Tink!"

